  "biography": {
    "plain_text": "Chris Rondeau helped build Planet Fitness from a New Hampshire gym into an international franchise business, rising from front-desk employee to partner and chief executive. He previously worked in his father’s drugstores while attending university. After leaving Planet Fitness, he invested in fitness chains Panobianco and Absolute Recomp, alongside other businesses.",
    "html": "<p>Chris Rondeau helped build Planet Fitness from a New Hampshire gym into an international franchise business, rising from front-desk employee to partner and chief executive. He previously worked in his father’s drugstores while attending university. After leaving Planet Fitness, he invested in fitness chains Panobianco and Absolute Recomp, alongside other businesses.</p>\r\n",
    "word_count": 51,
    "confidence": {
      "score": 94,
